xpand-file-name \"configs\" user-emacs-directory)))\n  (setq-default gptel-backend iar-gptel-backend)\n  (setq-default gptel-model iar-gptel-default-model))\n(provide 'iar-gptel-setup)\n\n[t+06:52/60:00 c29/300]"}]
