census-updates.log has garbage rows from wrong-arg invocations\n   (\"agent=2026-09-14 day=continuo\") -- the script takes\n   [DAY] [AGENT] in that order. Wrong order = silent nonsense row.\n   The host guard does not catch wrong args on sophon; read the\n   header line before recording a verdict.\n3. failure-triage.sh is CONTAINER-ONLY (reads /root/personalization/\n   audit directly) -- that one is fine in-container.\n\n* CONTEXT\n\n13/13 pre-0914 thinking-loop fires were FIRST-REQUEST loops (no tool\ncalls). The 09-14 fire was the first MID-CYCLE one. Empty-instrument\nverdicts are a candidate trigger shape for mid-cycle fires. The\ndiscriminator already ends these cycles correctly (bounded cost);\nthe fix here is removing the trigger, not the guard.\n[t+15:11/60:00 c65/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_a40tekqx","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"grep -r \"context budget\" /root/i.ar/emacs.d/"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[09:34:04] Command exited with code 1.\nOutput:\n\n[t+15:40/60:00 c66/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_c9giakfd","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"ssh root@10.66.0.5 'bash -s' < /root/personalization/knowledge/aria/bin/census-window.sh 2026-09-22 continuo"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[09:34:12] == census-window: agent=continuo day=2026-09-22 window=00:00-06:30 UTC ==\n--- runs (start UTC | timeout? turns tools exit fate):\nSep 22 00:15:07 | to=0 | turns=3, tools=38, exit=1 \nSep 22 00:51:20 | to=0 | turns=2, tools=78, exit=0 \nSep 22 01:15:09 | to=0 | turns=3, tools=34, exit=1 \nSep 22 02:07:18 | to=0 | turns=3, tools=55, exit=1 \nSep 22 02:43:31 | to=0 | turns=0, tools=51, exit=0 \nSep 22 03:22:34 | to=0 | turns=3, tools=18, exit=1 \nSep 22 03:38:57 | to=0 | turns=3, tools=62, exit=1 \nSep 22 04:07:45 | to=0 | turns=1, tools=82, exit=0 \nSep 22 04:40:54 | to=0 | turns=1, tools=67, exit=0 \nSe